---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { services } from '../../data/content';
import '../../styles/pages.css';
---
<Base title="Services" description="Website design and development, digital presence, strategy, business automation, and foundational SEO for businesses in Indonesia.">
  <section class="shell page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Reachly Studio / What we do</p><h1 class="display page-title">Start with the need.<br /><em>Then shape the solution.</em></h1><div class="intro-tail"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="lede">A better website. A more coherent presence. A smoother handoff. Five ways to work on what your business needs next.</p></div></section>
  <section class="shell service-directory" aria-label="Our five service areas">
    {services.map(service => <article class="service-row"><span class="folio">{service.number}</span><div><h2 class="display"><a href={`/services/${service.slug}`}>{service.name}</a></h2><p>{service.intro}</p></div><a class="service-row-link" href={`/services/${service.slug}`} aria-label={`Explore ${service.name}`}><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}
  </section>
  <section class="shell section-space split-editorial"><div><p class="eyebrow">Connected, not complicated</p><h2 class="display">One business.<br />Not five separate<br /><em>shopping lists.</em></h2></div><div class="reading"><p class="lede">These areas often overlap. The useful starting point is the problem, not how many services to buy.</p><p>A website may need clearer content before more pages. A workflow may need a better handoff before another tool. A search problem may start with the structure of the site itself. We use the conversation to identify the work that belongs together—and the work that can wait.</p><p>Every engagement needs an agreed scope. Deliverables, access, content, subscriptions, hosting, maintenance, and ongoing support are confirmed for the specific project, rather than assumed to be included.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Our approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="closing-panel"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">You do not need a perfect brief</p><h2 class="display">“I know something<br />needs to change.”</h2><p class="lede">That is a useful place to start. Tell us what is getting in the way.</p><a class="button button--dark" href="/contact">Prepare your project brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
